The useful mechanism is bet size: $B_{\mathrm{small}}<B_{\mathrm{large}}.$ A small bet limits exposure, but it also limits participation in the upside. A large concentrated bet increases both: $B_{\mathrm{large}}
\longrightarrow
\text{larger possible upside}
+
\text{larger exposure}.$

